What are Aerospace Bird Radar Systems?
Aerospace Bird Radar Systems are specialized surveillance solutions that use radar technology to detect and track avian activity near airports, military bases, and other critical airspaces. These systems emit electromagnetic waves to identify bird movements in real-time, providing early warnings to prevent potentially catastrophic collisions. The technology has become indispensable for aviation safety, particularly as air traffic continues growing at 4.3% annually worldwide.

