Market Challenges
High Implementation Costs: System deployments typically range from $500,000 to $2 million per installation, creating barriers for smaller airports and developing nations.
Technical Integration Complexities: About 30% of implementations require custom engineering to interface with existing air traffic control systems.
Workforce Limitations: Only 12 specialized training programs worldwide produce technicians skilled in both radar technology and ornithology.

